  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mi></mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be a function such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mn>0</mn> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow> </math> then"
  },
